#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:5
#: ea21d36918a54ef19a1852264b250c0b
msgid "旧版自旋螺旋（Spin Spiral）"
msgstr "Legacy Spin Spiral"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:7
#: 4242e911daa14e54a697c4159d780758
msgid "**分类：** 磁性"
msgstr "**Category:** Magnetism"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:9
#: afdb205fd3d948f599390dc70c623167
msgid ""
"[!WARNING] 这是一张仅用于加载旧工作流的兼容卡片，已从“新建卡片”目录隐藏。新建有限 q、Bloch、cycloidal 或一般螺旋路径请使用 [SOC / "
"纹理响应](soc-texture-response-card.md)。"
msgstr ""
"[!WARNING] This compatibility card is retained only for loading legacy workflows and "
"is hidden from `Add New Card`. For new finite-q, Bloch, cycloidal, or general spiral "
"paths, use [SOC / Texture Response](soc-texture-response-card.md)."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:12
#: 55c8c4763ba545ca866036a63bb5c873
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:14
#: 3c823c2799f34428bac265f0fbe84e44
msgid "旧版卡片按原子在传播轴上的投影坐标写入螺旋磁矩，并枚举周期、相位、手性和锥分量。它保留每个原子的磁矩模长，只改变方向。"
msgstr ""
"The legacy card assigns spiral moments from each atom's projected coordinate along a "
"propagation axis and enumerates period, phase, chirality, and cone component. It "
"preserves each atom's moment magnitude and changes only its direction."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:16
#: c50893c984a44834bb5ec9982a8ccdc8
msgid "该能力与 `SOC / Texture Response` 的有限 q 路径重复；新版卡片还提供完整路径、共格失败和响应元数据合同，因此不再为旧版卡片新增功能。"
msgstr ""
"This capability overlaps with the finite-q path in `SOC / Texture Response`. The "
"newer card also defines complete-path, commensurability-failure, and response-"
"metadata contracts, so no new features are being added to the legacy card."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:18
#: fee0707fb6f34e27bfe0e5340ec834f7
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principles and Equations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:20
#: 155e57aaaeea42d3af88bbc17fafebb7
msgid "对第 $i$ 个原子，旧版卡片生成"
msgstr "For atom $i$, the legacy card generates"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:22
#: 2ef08fab24b444e3b5617dc3017a1a0e
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf m_i=M_i\\left\\{\\sqrt{1-m_\\parallel^2}\n"
"[\\cos\\phi_i\\,\\mathbf e_1+\\sin\\phi_i\\,\\mathbf e_2]\n"
"+m_\\parallel\\hat{\\mathbf n}\\right\\},\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:28
#: f6ccb76522d24424bdb35454e1382d43
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\phi_i=s\\frac{2\\pi u_i}{L}+\\phi_0,\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:32
#: 050871e2b073447cb90a5c7beabce1c6
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"其中 $M_i$ 是输入磁矩模长，$u_i$ 是原子坐标在笛卡尔传播轴 $\\hat{\\mathbf n}$ 上的投影，$s=\\pm1$ "
"表示两种手性。$m_\\parallel=0$ 为平面螺旋，$0<|m_\\parallel|<1$ 为锥形螺旋。"
msgstr ""
"Here, $M_i$ is the input moment magnitude, $u_i$ is the projection of the atomic "
"coordinate onto the Cartesian propagation axis $\\hat{\\mathbf n}$, and $s=\\pm1$ "
"denotes the two chiralities. $m_\\parallel=0$ gives a planar spiral, while "
"$0<|m_\\parallel|<1$ gives a conical spiral."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:34
#: d67d5ec4566a46239d4132a43d2333b7
msgid "勾选公度筛选后，周期必须让所有周期晶格矢量上的相位增量都是 $360°$ 的整数倍；找不到相容周期时会明确失败，不再把原结构当作生成结果。"
msgstr ""
"When commensurability filtering is enabled, the period must make the phase increment "
"along every periodic lattice vector an integer multiple of $360°$. If no compatible "
"period is found, the card fails explicitly instead of treating the unchanged input as"
" a generated result."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:36
#: 36c2c8c1f1c2418fbd3a833d0a769ca7
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:38
#: 0b28c8ce552145e185d4794f81417034
msgid ""
"旧工作流若保存了 $L=20$ Å、双手性和 $m_\\parallel=0$，仍可加载并复现两份平面螺旋结构。若要新建同类路径，在 `SOC / Texture "
"Response` 中选择 `General spiral`，把传播方向设为原 `axis`，并使用"
msgstr ""
"A legacy workflow saved with $L=20$ Å, both chiralities, and $m_\\parallel=0$ can "
"still be loaded to reproduce two planar spiral structures. To create the same type of"
" path anew, select `General spiral` in `SOC / Texture Response`, set the propagation "
"direction to the old `axis`, and use"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:40
#: 0034073e3008460fbe4cf5446ecb7c84
msgid "|\\mathbf q|=2\\pi/L"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:42
#: 32a2ee8a4b1b4bc39fc2c88db6693140
msgid "换算基准波矢。运行前应先确认 q 与晶胞共格。"
msgstr ""
"to convert the reference wave vector. Confirm that q is commensurate with the cell "
"before running."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:44
#: 23420cc376e9477c84797e956cf9145b
msgid "迁移到 SOC / 纹理响应"
msgstr "Migrating to SOC / Texture Response"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md
#: b8f46270344d478a90571a308427141d
msgid "旧版设置"
msgstr "Legacy setting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md
#: fd91c2e5dbee4ce4961f3d2a9875deb8
msgid "新版对应设置"
msgstr "Current equivalent"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md
#: 22ce7c3723cf4ee791d19d4cb587745f
msgid "`axis`"
msgstr "`axis`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md
#: 2739e2412ec74552954abe7b2529eae7
msgid "`Propagation direction q (Cartesian)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md
#: 12cdb545930144a58ee0a1219ac70ab7
msgid "`period_range`"
msgstr "`period_range`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md
#: b33bfebfc16e48d5b0e16691790038a6
msgid "将每个 $L$ 换算为 $\\lvert\\mathbf q\\rvert=2\\pi/L$；需要多段时拆成明确路径"
msgstr ""
"Convert each $L$ to $\\lvert\\mathbf q\\rvert=2\\pi/L$; split multiple segments into "
"explicit paths"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md
#: 21b6bf4bb2814ba4b52e165910e7010c
msgid "`angle_gradient_range`"
msgstr "`angle_gradient_range`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md
#: 63aba915d7154ddb946f4171887a39d8
msgid "先用 $L=360/g$ 换算周期，再换算 q"
msgstr "Convert to a period with $L=360/g$, then convert to q"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md
#: 5cdf11a1b65348fc93d1e47202d238ae
msgid "`phase_range`"
msgstr "`phase_range`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md
#: 0e5c7a345c4e4383bc988da71b662d5b
msgid "`Phase Deg`；多个相位使用多张明确配置"
msgstr "`Phase Deg`; use separate explicit configurations for multiple phases"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md
#: 5a2f25ebbb684beab92a3996019beb9b
msgid "`mz`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md
#: 0559f6b755a74fc5aa72a763050c0978
msgid "`Cone Component`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md
#: 12edd71dab1a484eaf71fe4b877680ed
msgid "`chirality`"
msgstr "`chirality`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md
#: 8fa2cc72d684427a9905ab0aeedb5c5f
msgid "使用正负 q 扫描"
msgstr "Scan positive and negative q"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md
#: 47a32212fed3462caec320aa254bd2c5
msgid "`only_commensurate_periods`"
msgstr "`only_commensurate_periods`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md
#: a6a0a09b322b4878be6895db595b2b01
msgid "`Require Commensurate`，新卡默认开启"
msgstr "`Require Commensurate`, enabled by default in the new card"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md
#: d30f8a5cd7164455bc6fd0d88b29b4ce
msgid "`max_outputs`"
msgstr "`max_outputs`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md
#: 7c064efa299b4a539e7680155f70dcad
msgid "`Max Outputs`；新卡只接受完整路径"
msgstr "`Max Outputs`; the new card accepts complete paths only"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:57
#: 2c0b7fe0c5ed44baad21952ab359ebc3
msgid "`Layer-locked` 没有直接迁移项；如果确实需要离散分层且折返的纹理，使用“折返螺旋磁序”。"
msgstr ""
"`Layer-locked` has no direct migration setting. If a discrete, layer-resolved texture"
" with folding is required, use `Folded Helix`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:59
#: 0fa4620d626e448ca627d5428043b642
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:61
#: 6dfc6747eec24ca3a2436932d93b15d6
msgid "以下参数仅用于理解和复现旧 JSON。"
msgstr ""
"The following parameters are documented only for understanding and reproducing legacy"
" JSON."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:63
#: 22ce7c3723cf4ee791d19d4cb587745f
msgid "传播轴（axis）"
msgstr "Propagation Axis (axis)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:65
#: 4152dffca77546718234d71cea6595da
msgid "笛卡尔三维向量，默认 `(0,0,1)`。原子坐标在该方向上的投影决定螺旋相位。"
msgstr ""
"Three-dimensional Cartesian vector, default `(0,0,1)`. The projection of atomic "
"coordinates along this direction determines the spiral phase."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:67
#: 818fec2cbdc8475db167fb5b2a110f96
msgid "螺旋参数方式（spiral_parameter_mode）"
msgstr "spiral_parameter_mode"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:69
#: ef071daecdae4ded89b70cf7fb9a6f5b
msgid "默认 `Period (L_D)`。也可通过 `Angle gradient (deg/A)` 按每 Å 转角定义周期。"
msgstr ""
"Default `Period (L_D)`. The period may instead be defined by rotation per Å using "
"`Angle gradient (deg/A)`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:71
#: 12cdb545930144a58ee0a1219ac70ab7
msgid "周期范围（period_range）"
msgstr "period_range"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:73
#: 597a01cb63df4d8fbb92c93124df59ed
msgid "默认 `(20,40,10)` Å，格式为 `[最小值, 最大值, 步长]`。"
msgstr "Default `(20,40,10)` Å, in the form `[minimum, maximum, step]`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:75
#: 21b6bf4bb2814ba4b52e165910e7010c
msgid "角度梯度范围（angle_gradient_range）"
msgstr "angle_gradient_range"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:77
#: c93ebbf7017e424fa41a65a60d980cfd
msgid "默认 `(18,18,1)` 度/Å，格式为 `[最小值, 最大值, 步长]`，与周期满足 $g=360/L$。"
msgstr ""
"Default `(18,18,1)` degrees/Å, in the form `[minimum, maximum, step]`; it is related "
"to the period by $g=360/L$."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:79
#: 5cdf11a1b65348fc93d1e47202d238ae
msgid "相位范围（phase_range）"
msgstr "phase_range"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:81
#: f159b98e1c8a4f9f806ae42c5916a15e
msgid "默认 `(0,0,15)` 度。每个相位偏移都会增加一组输出。"
msgstr "Default `(0,0,15)` degrees. Every phase offset adds one output group."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:83
#: 5e30058618a04237a93d6f312fac831c
msgid "轴向分量范围（mz）"
msgstr "Axial-Component Range (mz)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:85
#: c6aa510544e14af28cde338e2cbc89b5
msgid "默认 `(0,0,0.1)`，表示归一化轴向分量 $m_\\parallel$，范围 `[-1,1]`。"
msgstr ""
"Default `(0,0,0.1)`, representing the normalized axial component $m_\\parallel$ in "
"the range `[-1,1]`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:87
#: 12edd71dab1a484eaf71fe4b877680ed
msgid "手性（chirality）"
msgstr "chirality"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:89
#: 30afa0278e7445528552c0471a87a39f
msgid "默认 `Both`。`Clockwise` 和 `Counterclockwise` 分别生成一个旋向；`Both` 生成一对。"
msgstr ""
"Default `Both`. `Clockwise` and `Counterclockwise` each generate one handedness; "
"`Both` generates a pair."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:91
#: 8094e365dcd943458cfa508643530c19
msgid "相位模式（phase_mode）"
msgstr "phase_mode"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:93
#: da79936f4f1342e4881061a83b813dc0
msgid "默认 `Continuous by position`。`Layer-locked` 会把投影距离足够接近的原子设为相同相位。"
msgstr ""
"Default `Continuous by position`. `Layer-locked` assigns the same phase to atoms "
"whose projected positions are sufficiently close."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:95
#: b945a0b419cc4480904b14984ce798ee
msgid "层容差（layer_tolerance）"
msgstr "Layer Tolerance (layer_tolerance)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:97
#: ad2a63a0424544d1afebe8784ebb0c52
msgid "默认 0.05 Å，仅在 `Layer-locked` 模式下用于合并相邻投影层。"
msgstr ""
"Default 0.05 Å. Used only in `Layer-locked` mode to merge neighboring projected "
"layers."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:99
#: 47a32212fed3462caec320aa254bd2c5
msgid "仅保留公度周期（only_commensurate_periods）"
msgstr "Keep Commensurate Periods Only (only_commensurate_periods)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:101
#: b169fb0c012f42feb4b35066f07a3499
msgid "默认关闭。开启后只生成与当前晶胞和 PBC 相容的周期；找不到时明确报错并尽可能给出超胞倍数建议。"
msgstr ""
"Disabled by default. When enabled, generates only periods compatible with the current"
" cell and PBC. If none is found, it reports an explicit error and, where possible, "
"suggests supercell multipliers."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:103
#: e5b3497f87074d11bc8cc3b70cb89679
msgid "磁矩来源（magnitude_source）"
msgstr "Moment Source (magnitude_source)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:105
#: a8809eb36c0b46139f1ba8ba6c10c0ad
msgid "默认 `Existing initial magmoms`，要求输入已有至少一个非零磁矩。`Map/default magnitude` 才会读取元素表和默认幅值。"
msgstr ""
"Default `Existing initial magmoms`, which requires at least one nonzero input moment."
" The element map and default magnitude are read only with `Map/default magnitude`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:107
#: af77f8c621f84764899cb71c7081a366
msgid "元素磁矩表（magmom_map）"
msgstr "magmom_map"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:109
#: 8e168044bc134bddbd50f3d4347454ee
msgid "元素表模式下使用，格式如 `Fe:2.2,Ni:0.6`。"
msgstr "Used in element-map mode, in a form such as `Fe:2.2,Ni:0.6`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:111
#: d6d767563c9f440098341680513a060c
msgid "默认磁矩（default_moment）"
msgstr "default_moment"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:113
#: 32f241052cfb4a8bba089a4818944916
msgid "默认 0.0。元素表未列出的元素使用该模长。"
msgstr "Default 0.0. Elements absent from the element map use this magnitude."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:115
#: aacc6d40e37f499c93f94197bcd8c8d0
msgid "应用元素（apply_elements）"
msgstr "apply_elements"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:117
#: 112574feb4a34ef285dd3dc35a2c9265
msgid "旧实现仅在元素表模式下用它筛选元素；已有磁矩模式不会据此筛选。迁移时应在上游建立明确的参考磁矩。"
msgstr ""
"The legacy implementation uses this to filter elements only in element-map mode; "
"existing-moment mode does not filter by it. When migrating, establish explicit "
"reference moments upstream."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:119
#: d30f8a5cd7164455bc6fd0d88b29b4ce
msgid "最大输出数（max_outputs）"
msgstr "max_outputs"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:121
#: ee3ff193d23c40399d9b2ee9c85c5308
msgid "默认 100。旧版按周期 × 相位 × 轴向分量 × 手性依次生成，并在达到此数量时截断；新版响应卡只接受完整路径。"
msgstr ""
"Default 100. The legacy card generates period × phase × axial component × chirality "
"combinations in order and truncates them at this count. The current response card "
"accepts complete paths only."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:123
#: 865e2ae857b24473bce5d0b0c1c70609
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:125
#: 5ae38b32cdc14748970ba8880a30db06
msgid "**为什么旧工作流现在会报“没有非零磁矩”？** 旧实现曾原样返回输入并显示成功，这并不是螺旋输出。请在上游写入磁矩，或在旧卡中明确选择元素表来源。"
msgstr ""
"**Why does a legacy workflow now report `no nonzero magnetic moments`?** The old "
"implementation once returned the input unchanged and reported success, which was not "
"a spiral output. Assign moments upstream or explicitly select the element-map source "
"in the legacy card."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:127
#: 1c9fbd204db4479f9c6508854085b318
msgid "**为什么公度筛选会失败？** 请求区间内没有与当前周期晶胞相容的周期。按错误中的建议扩胞，或迁移到 `SOC / Texture Response` 后重新设置 q。"
msgstr ""
"**Why does commensurability filtering fail?** The requested range contains no period "
"compatible with the current periodic cell. Expand the cell according to the error's "
"suggestion, or migrate to `SOC / Texture Response` and set q again."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:129
#: 32f08a29ea1e4c519844420a07acb918
msgid "输出"
msgstr "Output"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:131
#: 5d6f5f0c591d45f2b663ecc35e5c9946
msgid ""
"成功输出写入 `spin:R:3` 并同步 ASE 初始磁矩；`Config_type` 使用 `Helix(...)` 或 "
"`Spiral(...)`。该操作没有随机性，相同输入与参数产生相同结果。"
msgstr ""
"Successful outputs are written to `spin:R:3` and synchronized with ASE initial "
"magnetic moments; `Config_type` uses `Helix(...)` or `Spiral(...)`. The operation has"
" no randomness, so identical inputs and parameters produce identical results."

#~ msgid "其中 m_z = m_parallel / |m| 是无量纲轴向分量。m_z=0 为平面 helix，m_z=0 为 conical spiral。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Here `m_z = m_parallel / |m|` is the "
#~ "dimensionless component along the propagation axis."
#~ " `m_z = 0` gives a planar helix; "
#~ "nonzero `m_z` gives a conical spiral."

#~ msgid "如果极小值位置仍偏离，加密 `period_range` 扫描（例如 `[10, 40, 5]`）"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "If the position of the minimum remains "
#~ "inaccurate, densify `period_range`, for example to"
#~ " `[10, 40, 5]`."

#~ msgid "**`Magmom Map`** / **`Default Moment`**：仅在 `Map/default magnitude` 模式下生效。"
#~ msgstr "**`Magmom Map`** / **`Default Moment`**: used only in `Map/default magnitude` mode."

#~ msgid "`float`，默认 `0.0`。只作为 `magmom_map` 未命中元素的兜底幅值。关键磁性元素应显式列出，非磁元素通常保持 0。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default `0.0`. Used only when an "
#~ "element is absent from `magmom_map`. List "
#~ "important magnetic elements explicitly; nonmagnetic "
#~ "elements should normally remain at 0."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**输出为空 / 只有原始输入。** 磁矩幅值全为 0（检查 `magnitude_source`"
#~ " 和 `magmom_map`）。`Period Filter` 开启且区间内没有相容周期——卡片会打印建议超胞倍数。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**No output is produced, or only the "
#~ "original input remains.** All moment magnitudes "
#~ "may be zero; check `magnitude_source` and "
#~ "`magmom_map`. Alternatively, `Period Filter` found "
#~ "no commensurate period in the requested range;"
#~ " use the reported supercell suggestion."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**相邻层相位递进不对。** 检查 `Propagation Axis` 是否指向预期的传播方向。`Phase"
#~ " Mode = Layer-locked` 时调整 `layer_tolerance`。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Phase progression between layers is incorrect.**"
#~ " Check `Propagation Axis`. In `Phase Mode ="
#~ " Layer-locked`, also tune `layer_tolerance` so"
#~ " physical layers are neither split nor "
#~ "merged."

#~ msgid "**输出比预期的多很多。** `period_range` 步长太小，或 `mz` 范围太宽。设 `max_outputs` 上限，先小步长试跑再扩大。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Far more structures are produced than "
#~ "expected.** `period_range` may use a fine step"
#~ " or `mz` may span too many values. "
#~ "Set `max_outputs` and validate a small scan"
#~ " before expanding it."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "对输入结构按一维相位场写入非共线 `initial_magmoms`，生成一批不同周期、相位、手性和轴向分量的 spin "
#~ "spiral / helix / conical spiral "
#~ "初始构型。支持两种等价的主控方式：直接扫周期 L_D 或扫每 Angstrom 转角梯度。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Write noncollinear `initial_magmoms` from a one-"
#~ "dimensional phase field, generating spin-spiral, "
#~ "planar-helix, and conical-spiral initial "
#~ "states over periods, phases, chiralities, and "
#~ "axial components. Control the spiral either by"
#~ " scanning its period `L_D` or by scanning"
#~ " the rotation gradient in degrees per Å."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\\mathbf{m}(u)=\\sqrt{1-m_z^2}\\left[\\cos\\phi(u)\\,\\mathbf{e}_1+\\sin\\phi(u)\\,\\mathbf{e}_2\\right]"
#~ " + m_z\\,\\hat{\\mathbf{n}}"
#~ msgstr ""

#~ msgid "\\phi(u)=s\\cdot \\frac{2\\pi u}{L_D}+\\phi_0,\\qquad s\\in\\{-1,+1\\}"
#~ msgstr ""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "其中 $m_z=m_\\parallel/|\\mathbf m|$ 是无量纲轴向分量。$m_z=0$ 为平面"
#~ " helix， $0<|m_z|<1$ 为 conical spiral，$|m_z|=1$ "
#~ "是完全沿轴的共线极限。"
#~ msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#~ msgid "**关键限制：** 这张卡只写入初始磁矩纹理，不改变晶体结构。如果当前晶格与目标周期不相容，需要先扩胞。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Important limitation:** This card changes only "
#~ "the initial moment texture. If the target "
#~ "period is incompatible with the current "
#~ "periodic cell, enlarge the structure first."

#~ msgid "场景：模型在螺旋磁结构上能量曲线完全不对"
#~ msgstr "Scenario: the predicted energy curve is wrong for spiral magnetic structures"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "你训练了一个 NEP 模型，训练集里有 FM 和 AFM "
#~ "构型。模型在共线磁序上表现尚可，但一跑到具有螺旋磁序的构型（如 CrNb3S6 或 MnSi 中的 "
#~ "chiral helimagnet），能量曲线形状完全错误——周期依赖的能量极小值位置偏离 DFT 结果超过 "
#~ "30%。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "You trained an NEP model with FM and "
#~ "AFM configurations. It performs acceptably for "
#~ "collinear orders, but for spiral states such"
#~ " as chiral helices in CrNb3S6 or MnSi, "
#~ "the shape of the energy curve is wrong"
#~ " and the period-dependent minimum differs "
#~ "from DFT by more than 30%."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**诊断思路：** 模型从未见过磁矩在空间中连续旋转的构型。FM/AFM "
#~ "训练集隐式告诉了模型\"磁矩方向在空间中是分段常数\"的假设。需要在训练集里加入不同周期的螺旋磁纹理，让模型学习 q "
#~ "空间不同波矢下的能量响应。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Diagnosis:** The model has never seen "
#~ "moments rotate continuously through space. FM "
#~ "and AFM examples cover only a few "
#~ "discrete directional patterns. Add spiral textures"
#~ " over several wave vectors so the model "
#~ "can learn the energy response `E(q)` across"
#~ " the relevant region of reciprocal space."

#~ msgid "**输入：** 一个已知磁矩幅值的磁性结构（如 MnSi 单胞，Mn 磁矩约 2.0 μB，螺旋沿 [111] 方向）"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Input:** A magnetic structure with known "
#~ "moment magnitudes, such as an MnSi cell "
#~ "with approximately 2.0 μB on Mn and "
#~ "propagation along [111]."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**目标：** 沿 [111] 方向扫描 3 个周期（20/30/40 "
#~ "Angstrom），3 个全局相位（0/30/60 度），纯 helix（mz=0），正反手性成对。共 3x3x2"
#~ " = 18 个螺旋构型"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Goal:** Along [111], scan three periods (20,"
#~ " 30, and 40 Å), three global phases "
#~ "(0°, 30°, and 60°), a planar helix "
#~ "(`mz=0`), and both chiralities: 3 × 3 ×"
#~ " 2 = 18 structures."

#~ msgid "**参数设置：**"
#~ msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#~ msgid "`Propagation Axis` = `[1, 1, 1]`"
#~ msgstr ""

#~ msgid "`Spiral Parameter` = `Period (L_D)`"
#~ msgstr ""

#~ msgid "`Period Range` = `[20, 40, 10]`"
#~ msgstr ""

#~ msgid "`Phase Range` = `[0, 60, 30]`"
#~ msgstr ""

#~ msgid "`m_parallel Range` = `[0, 0, 0.1]`"
#~ msgstr ""

#~ msgid "`手性`（`chirality`） = `Both`"
#~ msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#~ msgid "**输出：** 18 个结构，磁矩沿 [111] 方向逐层旋转，带 `Helix(L=...,ph=...,mz=0,chi=...,ax=...)` 标签。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Output:** 18 structures whose moments rotate "
#~ "along [111], labeled `Helix(L=...,ph=...,mz=0,chi=...,ax=...)`."

