#~ msgstr "Propagation axis and period"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(0.0,"
#~ " 0.0, 1.0)`。螺旋相位沿此方向传播，原子坐标在该方向的投影用于计算相位，格式 `[x, y, "
#~ "z]`。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`, default:"
#~ " `(0.0, 0.0, 1.0)`. Direction along which "
#~ "the phase propagates. Each atom's projected "
#~ "coordinate on this axis determines its phase."
#~ " Format: `[x, y, z]`."

#~ msgid "生效条件：涉及方向、分层、表面或向量初始化的模式都会使用。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Used by modes that depend on a "
#~ "direction, layering, a surface, or vector "
#~ "initialization."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`str`，默认 `'Period (L_D)'`。`Period (L_D)` 适合已知螺旋周期或要扫 "
#~ "E(q) 曲线；`Angle gradient (deg/A)` 适合直接控制每埃旋转角。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`str`, default: `'Period (L_D)'`. Use `Period "
#~ "(L_D)` when scanning known spiral periods or"
#~ " an `E(q)` curve. Use `Angle gradient "
#~ "(deg/A)` to control rotation directly in "
#~ "degrees per Å."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 "
#~ "`(20.0, 40.0, 10.0)`。`[min, max, step]` 格式，单位 "
#~ "Å。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`, default:"
#~ " `(20.0, 40.0, 10.0)`. Period range in Å,"
#~ " expressed as `[minimum, maximum, step]`."

#~ msgid "保守：`[20, 20, 5]`（单周期）"
#~ msgstr "Conservative: `[20, 20, 5]` (one period)"

#~ msgid "平衡：`[10, 40, 10]`（4 个周期）"
#~ msgstr "Balanced: `[10, 40, 10]` (four periods)"

#~ msgid "探索：`[4, 80, 4]`（宽范围）"
#~ msgstr "Exploratory: `[4, 80, 4]` (broad range)"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 "
#~ "`(18.0, 18.0, 1.0)`。`[min, max, step]` 格式，单位 "
#~ "deg/A。值越大旋转越快——360/L_D = 梯度。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`, default:"
#~ " `(18.0, 18.0, 1.0)`. Rotation-gradient range "
#~ "in degrees per Å, expressed as `[minimum, "
#~ "maximum, step]`. The gradient is `360 / "
#~ "L_D`, so larger values correspond to shorter"
#~ " periods."

#~ msgid "`float`，默认 `0.05`。投影差小于此阈值的原子归为同一层。仅在 `Layer-locked` 模式下生效。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default: `0.05`. Atoms whose projected "
#~ "coordinates differ by less than this tolerance"
#~ " are assigned to the same layer. Used "
#~ "only in `Layer-locked` mode."

#~ msgid "`bool`，默认 `False`。勾选后只保留与当前晶格周期边界相容的周期，程序在指定区间内自动搜索相容周期。如果没有相容周期，卡片会给出建议的超胞倍数。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`bool`, default: `False`. Retain only periods "
#~ "commensurate with the current periodic cell. "
#~ "The card searches the requested range and, "
#~ "if none fit, reports a suggested supercell "
#~ "multiplier."

